Output docs/vhstape.gif
Set Shell bash
Set FontFamily "CaskaydiaCove NFM"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 760
Set Height 230
Set Padding 12
Set Framerate 30
Set Theme "Dracula"
Env WELCOME_DEMO "1"
Hide
Type "clear; tte -i ~/.config/welcome/banner.txt --frame-rate 180 vhstape --final-gradient-stops 39ff14 00e5ff --final-gradient-direction horizontal" Enter
Show
Sleep 5.5s
